<title>USA: BTG gets 10-yr $30 mln courts contract.</title>
<headline>BTG gets 10-yr $30 mln courts contract.</headline>
<dateline>FAIRFAX, Va. 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>BTG Inc said Wednesday that it has been awarded a contract by the Administrative Office of the U.S. Courts for its SQL Database Management System Replacement requirement as a result of a competitive procurement.</p>
<p>The $30 million, 10-year program is intended to provide a database environment that can grow and respond to the data handling requirements of a large and varied judicial community of 200 federal courts.</p>
</text>
